## Nyxuri SwayFX effects configuration
# effects_normal: Normal effects configuration. Stock translucent and background blur
# Note: While Niri sets lower opacity for unfocused windows to , Sway's criteria do not natively support focus states. Instead, we use default_dim_inactive to achieve a similar effect.

# Window manager side opacity affects text readability, use with caution.
opacity 0.9
default_dim_inactive 0.1

blur enable
blur_passes 3
blur_radius 10
blur_noise 0.001
blur_saturation 2
